      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. so if i use it mostly for work but obviously sit in it sometimes when im just at my desk, it's still okay to write it off? also i noticed some other smaller stuff like desk lamps and a monitor stand are also in there. is there a specific dollar amount where i have to stop calling them 'expenses' and start calling them 'assets' or whatever? i dont want to mess up my filing.",
