      "content": "that makes sense. one more thing though—i was looking through my bank statements from last month and i have a few small charges that dont look familiar. like random $15 or $20 fees that i dont remember authorizing. is that just something that happens with business accounts or should i be worried about my funds just disappearing or something? it's driving me crazy trying to track everything down.",
